#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-services.php
msgid "SM Services"
msgstr "SM Services"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-services.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-services.php
msgid ""
"Fabrication and site services of companies and professionals: service pages "
"with photos, capabilities, equipment and coverage, service requests answered"
" with a quote, portfolio of completed projects. Engineering studies are "
"handled by SM Engineering. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"Services de fabrication et de chantier des entreprises et des professionnels"
" : pages de service avec photos, capacités, équipements et zones couvertes, "
"demandes de service avec devis, réalisations. Les études d’ingénierie "
"passent par SM Engineering. Nécessite SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-services.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

